            <div xml:id="d22-a1">

                <pb facs="0160" n="42" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg42"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Count Kalnoky to Count de Crenneville.</hi></head>
                <p>You will please tender to the President of the United States, in the name of His
                    Majesty, of the Government, and of the people of Austria-Hungary, the warmest
                    thanks for the telegram of condolence presented through Minister Lawton, which
                    was received here with the highest appreciation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kalknoky.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
